OL,3,GNEWSAI was stabbed twice - sentences
OL,4,Afor knife attackers need to be tougher
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former doorman who has been stabbed
OL,7,Ftwice says he wants to see tougher
OL,8,Fsentences for knife crime offenders to
OL,9,Fmake the country safer.
OL,11,FCarl Wayne - formerly Moore - suffered
OL,12,Fa near-fatal stabbing in 2009 while
OL,13,Fworking in Derby. His attacker was
OL,14,Fjailed for nearly four years.
OL,16,FThen, last year, a neighbour slashed
OL,17,Fhis hand and was given a nine-month
OL,18,Fprison sentence.
